WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.052 --> 00:00:07.207
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:07.208 --> 00:00:10.413
What do they see?

3
00:00:10.414 --> 00:00:17.782
They see a fire station.

4
00:00:17.783 --> 00:00:25.179
The blobs go inside.

5
00:00:25.180 --> 00:01:00.106
They see firefighter helmets.

6
00:01:00.107 --> 00:01:31.718
They see boots and jackets.

7
00:01:31.719 --> 00:01:55.862
They see a tall pole.

8
00:01:55.863 --> 00:02:04.943
They see a big fire truck.

9
00:02:04.944 --> 00:02:35.005
They see thick hoses.

10
00:02:35.006 --> 00:02:45.684
They see a long ladder.

11
00:02:45.685 --> 00:02:53.402
Uh-oh! They hear loud noises.

12
00:02:53.403 --> 00:03:01.583
They see firefighters.

13
00:03:01.584 --> 00:03:12.290
The blobs are going for a ride.

14
00:03:12.291 --> 00:03:15.643
Silly blobs!

15
00:03:15.644 --> 00:03:18.938
Good-bye!

